    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Noel Kelly Auctioneers are delighted to present 28 Belfry House, a charming 2-bedroom first floor apartment which boasts well-proportioned accommodation throughout in this popular residential area. The accommodation briefly comprises an entrance hall, lounge/dining room with balcony off, fully fitted kitchen, family bathroom and two, large bedrooms. The property benefits from gas fired central heating, two parking spaces and a large balcony off the kitchen. \r\n28 Belfry House is located in an exceptionally convenient location with excellent connectivity to Swords and the surrounding areas. The development is adjacent to Forrest Little Golf Club and benefits from an excellent range of local amenities, including a Tesco Express, pharmacy with medical centre, and crèche, all within easy walking distance. Swords Village is just minutes away, offering an extensive selection of shops, cafés, restaurants, bars, and leisure facilities, including the popular Pavilions Shopping Centre. The area is exceptionally well served by public transport, with frequent bus services and the Swords Express providing access to Dublin City Centre in approximately 15 minutes. The property is within close proximity to Airside Business & Retail Park, Dublin Airport, and the M1 and M50 motorways, making it an ideal choice for commuters and frequent travellers alike. Early viewing is highly recommended."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Hall\t\tSemi solid timber floor, hot press, storage closet, alarm\r\n\r\nLounge/Dining Room  \t3.78 x 4.92\tSemi solid floor, door to balcony\r\nBalcony\t\t\r\nKitchen\t2.50 x 3.35\tTiled floor, fully fitted kitchen, oven, hob, extractor, washing machine, dishwasher, fridge freezer\r\n\r\nBathroom\t2.25 x 1.92\tTiled floor& partial walls, w.c, w.h.b, bath suite, towel rail, shaving light\r\n\t\t\r\nBedroom 1 \t4.30 x 3.25\tCarpet floor, fitted wardrobe, blinds\r\n\t\t\r\nBedroom 2\t4.23 x 2.61\tCarpet floor, fitted wardrobe, blinds"
      },
      {
